Citation Lorenz C, Dougherty TJ, Lory S. 2016. Transcriptional responses of Escherichia coli to a small-molecule inhibitor of LolCDE, an essential component of the lipoprotein transport pathway. J Bacteriol 198:3162–3175. doi:10.1128/JB.00502-16.

